  "releaseNotes": "- Updated UDP design with a cleaner structure.\n      - Split shared logic into base transport classes.\n      - Added `UdpSession` as a light endpoint session wrapper.\n      - Improved `UdpServer`, `UdpClient`, and `UdpSession` flow.\n      - Fixed async UDP handling for `ReceiveFrom` and `SendTo`.\n      - Improved receive loop stability.\n      - Reduced duplicate code and made maintenance easier.\n      - Made extension easier for new transports and protocols.\n      - Focused on modern unicast and NAT-friendly usage.",
